WEBVTT

00:21.170 --> 00:23.550
<i>It can't be damaged by spirit energy.</i>

00:23.550 --> 00:24.420
<i>Then...</i>

00:32.020 --> 00:33.680
<i>Magic doesn't work either.</i>

00:34.230 --> 00:36.470
<i>And the exit's disappeared.</i>

00:37.380 --> 00:38.870
<i>A boss room...</i>

00:38.870 --> 00:43.410
<i>And one of the ones where you can't 
escape unless you defeat the boss?</i>

00:46.140 --> 00:50.010
<i>Man... What horrible luck.</i>

00:54.490 --> 00:55.780
<i>But even so...</i>

00:56.150 --> 01:00.450
<i>I'm an adventurer, which means I'll 
fight to the end without giving up!</i>

01:01.180 --> 01:05.830
<i>I don't know if my sword will hold, but if 
it's an undead, divinity should work on it!</i>

03:03.910 --> 03:05.560
You awake?

03:06.950 --> 03:11.250
Existential
Evolution

03:07.700 --> 03:08.840
Yeah...

03:08.840 --> 03:11.650
Oh, right! There was this huge skeleton...

03:13.240 --> 03:17.500
The most I can do is patch you up.

03:17.870 --> 03:20.150
No... thank you.

03:23.230 --> 03:25.210
You defeated it?

03:25.950 --> 03:26.830
Yeah.

03:28.850 --> 03:30.670
I-It's huge!

03:30.670 --> 03:33.160
If it had a magic stone of this size,

03:33.160 --> 03:35.070
it must've been an incredibly 
powerful monster!

03:35.460 --> 03:37.110
You're incredible.

03:37.770 --> 03:39.340
I was lucky.

03:40.720 --> 03:42.510
You can have it, if you want.

03:43.060 --> 03:45.050
Are you serious?

03:45.050 --> 03:48.170
Not without condition, though.

03:48.410 --> 03:49.590
What do you want?

03:49.590 --> 03:54.570
I can't see how somebody like me could be 
of use to a powerful adventurer like you.

03:54.950 --> 03:57.170
This is what I look like now.

03:58.770 --> 04:01.810
A monster got me.

04:02.460 --> 04:05.860
I can't go into the shops, or the guild.

04:06.580 --> 04:10.130
I want you to do that for me.

04:11.800 --> 04:15.340
Sure, even I can do that.

04:15.340 --> 04:18.490
But is that really all you need?

04:18.490 --> 04:20.850
The deal seems one-sided in my favor.

04:21.160 --> 04:23.770
Then one more thing.

04:25.620 --> 04:30.890
Let me eat and drink at your 
restaurant whenever I want.

04:30.890 --> 04:32.270
For free.

04:36.480 --> 04:39.300
Are you stupid or something?

04:43.020 --> 04:44.760
Eat all you want...

04:45.280 --> 04:48.530
I won't let my restaurant 
go bankrupt this time!

04:48.530 --> 04:49.920
I'll work extra hard!

04:51.590 --> 04:53.610
Thanks so much, mister!

04:56.270 --> 04:57.300
Here.

04:57.300 --> 04:58.770
We're going home.

04:58.770 --> 05:00.410
O-Okay...

05:02.560 --> 05:04.590
But how?

05:07.380 --> 05:09.050
Go over there.

05:09.690 --> 05:11.540
There's nothing there.

05:13.320 --> 05:16.080
<i>So he can't see the magic circles.</i>

05:17.080 --> 05:20.350
It should take you back
to where we came from.

05:20.350 --> 05:21.610
Gotcha.

05:21.610 --> 05:23.790
If you say it, I believe it.

05:31.780 --> 05:34.040
<i>I want to go on ahead...</i>

05:34.040 --> 05:35.520
<i>But it'll have to be another time.</i>

05:40.670 --> 05:44.950
This is my restaurant, 
the Red Dragon Tavern.

05:45.870 --> 05:48.240
<i>It's cleaner than I thought.</i>

05:48.240 --> 05:50.630
<i>Maybe the food's so bad it kills you?</i>

05:51.310 --> 05:54.030
Honey, you're safe!

05:54.030 --> 05:54.750
Ow...

05:57.760 --> 05:59.460
Are you hurt?

05:59.460 --> 06:01.510
We have to call a doctor!

06:01.510 --> 06:03.420
Calm down, Isabelle.

06:03.420 --> 06:04.560
I'm fine.

06:04.560 --> 06:07.040
I got a little hurt, but he patched me up.

06:08.370 --> 06:10.530
Oh, how silly of me.

06:11.070 --> 06:14.590
He saved my life.

06:14.590 --> 06:15.580
Oh, also...

06:16.940 --> 06:18.680
Just look at this!

06:19.060 --> 06:20.820
Th-That's...

06:20.820 --> 06:23.210
Amazing, huh? He gave it to me!

06:23.210 --> 06:24.060
No!

06:24.060 --> 06:30.330
If you get tricked again... we 
don't have anything left to pay...

06:31.210 --> 06:33.780
Isabelle, it's true.

06:33.980 --> 06:36.620
He may not look it, but 
he's actually a great guy.

06:36.620 --> 06:39.680
He heard about my debt 
and decided to help me.

06:41.340 --> 06:43.890
Of course, not for free.

06:43.890 --> 06:46.660
I'm going to be helping him from now on.

06:46.660 --> 06:48.860
Will you be doing something dangerous again?

06:48.860 --> 06:50.920
It'll be fine. Just errands.

06:53.300 --> 06:57.040
And I promised he can eat here for free.

06:57.570 --> 07:00.020
But that's barely anything...

07:00.880 --> 07:02.310
It's true.

07:03.960 --> 07:04.680
Then...

07:04.950 --> 07:05.830
Yeah.

07:06.320 --> 07:09.540
I know I worried you, but it's okay now.

07:11.470 --> 07:14.660
Oh, I never did introduce myself.

07:14.660 --> 07:17.810
I'm Lorris. Lorris Cariello.

07:18.160 --> 07:19.270
And this is...

07:19.270 --> 07:20.620
Isabelle.

07:21.230 --> 07:23.850
Thank you so much.

07:24.170 --> 07:26.250
Don't worry about it.

07:26.250 --> 07:27.160
Farewell.

07:28.850 --> 07:31.410
You're leaving already, mister?

07:31.410 --> 07:35.470
You saved my life. At 
least tell me your name!

07:38.890 --> 07:43.310
Can you promise you won't tell anybody?

07:43.540 --> 07:44.580
Yeah.

07:44.580 --> 07:48.400
I'll keep it a secret. And I'll 
keep calling you "mister."

07:50.420 --> 07:52.000
Rentt.

07:52.920 --> 07:55.160
Thanks, Mister.

07:55.620 --> 07:59.050
Come for a meal any time you like! 
We'll be happy to have you!

08:05.010 --> 08:06.530
<i>It's a shame...</i>

08:07.710 --> 08:09.900
<i>If he was a liar...</i>

08:09.900 --> 08:12.960
<i>Just a villain with no family...</i>

08:15.290 --> 08:17.150
<i>That would've been so much better.</i>

08:23.600 --> 08:25.910
<i>I'd rather test it on someone evil.</i>

08:25.910 --> 08:29.310
<i>That's why I didn't ask his name.</i>

08:29.770 --> 08:31.210
<i>It's such a shame...</i>

08:35.930 --> 08:37.490
Lorraine...

08:38.520 --> 08:42.290
<i>No... What am I...?</i>

08:45.780 --> 08:48.370
Lorraine...

08:53.460 --> 08:55.320
You're a bit late.

08:55.320 --> 08:57.970
How was the labyrinth? 
Did you see the dragon?

08:59.430 --> 09:00.640
No...

09:00.840 --> 09:04.750
Oh, where did you put the 
letters I got from the empire?

09:04.750 --> 09:06.530
I need to answer them,

09:06.530 --> 09:08.920
or the old men are gonna come 
and break down my door.

09:10.760 --> 09:12.000
What's wrong?

09:12.000 --> 09:13.920
Was there a problem?

09:13.920 --> 09:15.830
You don't sound so good.

09:16.570 --> 09:18.980
That's not true.

09:18.980 --> 09:21.280
I'm happy...

09:21.280 --> 09:23.240
Oh? Did something good happen?

09:27.030 --> 09:29.250
R-Rentt?

09:29.250 --> 09:30.660
What happened?

09:30.660 --> 09:32.520
Are you drunk?

09:32.520 --> 09:35.180
No, I guess an undead can't get drunk.

09:35.180 --> 09:38.350
Lorraine, I...

09:38.880 --> 09:42.350
Y-Yeah? What?

09:42.770 --> 09:43.760
Rentt...

09:52.880 --> 09:55.150
R-Rentt!

09:55.150 --> 09:56.260
You...

10:02.670 --> 10:05.250
D-Delicious!

10:05.820 --> 10:10.800
Rentt... are you still in there?

10:10.800 --> 10:11.790
Rentt!

10:18.940 --> 10:21.810
Good... you're still there, then.

10:22.120 --> 10:23.180
In that case...

10:31.510 --> 10:32.860
You're alive, right?

10:33.250 --> 10:34.600
For now, sleep.

10:35.430 --> 10:37.370
I'll hear your apology when you wake up.

10:39.090 --> 10:42.530
If you're going to grab me like 
that, do it when you're sober.

10:43.070 --> 10:46.430
You can devour me any time you like.

10:54.830 --> 10:56.590
What was I...?

10:56.590 --> 10:58.380
Are you awake, Rentt?

10:59.540 --> 11:01.950
Yeah. My head...

11:04.260 --> 11:06.690
I was in the labyrinth...

11:06.910 --> 11:10.280
Do you feel like something 
strange is in control of you?

11:10.670 --> 11:12.140
Or giving you strange impulses?

11:17.560 --> 11:18.810
Very good, then.

11:19.330 --> 11:21.730
Lorraine, I'm sorry.

11:22.720 --> 11:24.550
I'll accept your apology.

11:24.550 --> 11:26.470
But there's nothing to worry about.

11:26.470 --> 11:28.610
It was an unpleasant accident.

11:28.610 --> 11:29.370
That's all.

11:29.370 --> 11:31.210
But that's not...

11:32.330 --> 11:34.410
I'm more interested in 
how much you remember.

11:35.260 --> 11:38.000
I remember attacking you.

11:39.170 --> 11:45.740
No... I met a man in the labyrinth, 
and he looked delicious to me...

11:45.740 --> 11:47.880
I started going crazy.

11:48.270 --> 11:52.590
And you looked so delicious, 
I couldn't help myself...

11:52.590 --> 11:55.000
I expected this, to a degree.

11:55.390 --> 11:56.870
You did?

11:56.870 --> 11:57.710
Yes.

11:57.710 --> 12:00.880
Ghouls prefer the flesh and blood of humans.

12:00.880 --> 12:03.740
More importantly, is your body okay?

12:04.270 --> 12:07.130
I almost never hold back.

12:07.130 --> 12:09.130
It seems okay.

12:09.130 --> 12:10.910
I'm glad.

12:10.910 --> 12:12.800
But you took damage, I'm sure.

12:12.800 --> 12:14.390
So rest quietly.

12:15.400 --> 12:17.370
I will too.

12:18.470 --> 12:19.460
Lorraine...

12:20.260 --> 12:21.840
Let me see it.

12:26.800 --> 12:30.850
I'd just sold all my potions 
to the magical pharmacy.

12:30.850 --> 12:31.830
Don't worry.

12:31.830 --> 12:35.060
Once I get the ingredients in the 
morning, I'll make one right away.

12:36.950 --> 12:38.480
Let me take care of it.

12:40.720 --> 12:43.820
You can use that much divinity?

12:43.820 --> 12:44.790
Yeah.

12:44.790 --> 12:47.100
I should be able to do basic healing.

12:47.910 --> 12:50.890
I've never been healed by divinity before.

12:50.890 --> 12:53.950
It feels nice. It's warm.

12:55.880 --> 12:56.830
Well?

12:57.600 --> 13:00.010
Yeah, the pain's gone.

13:01.950 --> 13:04.140
This is amazing. It's all better.

13:04.760 --> 13:05.780
Not yet.

13:15.670 --> 13:18.410
I guess I can't pretend to 
be damaged goods anymore.

13:19.550 --> 13:20.910
Don't worry about it.

13:23.560 --> 13:24.660
You...

13:29.120 --> 13:32.660
At this point, you might be able 
to pass it off as old wounds.

13:34.320 --> 13:36.260
What about my face?

13:36.260 --> 13:38.830
The mask has changed form!

13:38.830 --> 13:41.510
What, you didn't notice?

13:41.510 --> 13:43.220
When did that happen?

13:43.840 --> 13:45.880
I'll need to hide this...

13:48.920 --> 13:53.020
That mask isn't just cursed, I don't think.

13:53.020 --> 13:55.510
Is it responding to your desires?

13:55.510 --> 13:56.400
Let me try.

14:01.610 --> 14:03.320
That's rare.

14:03.320 --> 14:07.010
I've heard of magical swords 
with wills of their own.

14:08.400 --> 14:12.040
If you can control it, 
maybe you can take it off?

14:12.040 --> 14:13.110
I see...

14:13.520 --> 14:16.800
Come off... Come off!

14:17.860 --> 14:19.210
Can I try pulling on it?

14:19.710 --> 14:20.550
Yes.

14:25.900 --> 14:27.270
No luck.

14:27.270 --> 14:29.100
Well, that's not entirely great.

14:29.100 --> 14:33.840
Though, your face is still like an undead's. 
You'll need to hide it for a while anyway.

14:35.520 --> 14:36.880
Yeah.

14:36.880 --> 14:38.510
I'll stay like this for a while.

14:38.800 --> 14:41.650
Your words are a lot clearer now, too.

14:41.650 --> 14:43.800
Yeah, it's much easier to talk.

14:44.620 --> 14:46.940
Did I existential evolve?

14:47.260 --> 14:49.860
I would assume so.

14:50.530 --> 14:53.330
I defeated a strong monster, yes, but...

14:53.770 --> 14:57.280
Last time, I evolved right 
after I defeated the monster.

15:01.960 --> 15:07.020
Perhaps it was because you 
fed on my blood and flesh?

15:07.810 --> 15:10.590
It's not that strange an idea.

15:10.890 --> 15:14.760
You're not a ghoul anymore. 
You're closer to a ghast.

15:14.760 --> 15:16.060
A ghast?

15:16.060 --> 15:19.490
I've almost never seen one... but 
they're servants of vampires, right?

15:19.490 --> 15:20.480
Yes.

15:20.480 --> 15:23.610
They're weaker than even a lesser vampire.

15:23.610 --> 15:25.870
And that's what you look like right now.

15:25.870 --> 15:27.940
But why a ghast?

15:27.940 --> 15:30.140
Even among us academics,

15:30.140 --> 15:32.930
existential evolution is just like 
the origins of the labyrinth itself.

15:32.930 --> 15:34.970
A complete mystery.

15:35.440 --> 15:36.710
But...

15:37.820 --> 15:41.070
Rentt, would you like to hear my hypothesis?

15:41.070 --> 15:43.200
Yes, please, tell me!

15:44.330 --> 15:46.690
All right, I'll tell you.

15:46.690 --> 15:50.080
Of course, I would've told 
you even if you'd refused.

15:50.520 --> 15:51.790
Don't fall asleep.

15:53.800 --> 15:57.080
Now then, where to begin...

15:57.080 --> 16:00.860
I didn't see it, but you were 
a skeleton at first, right?

16:01.050 --> 16:04.600
Yeah, that was... interesting.

16:04.600 --> 16:06.930
And then you became a ghoul.

16:06.930 --> 16:07.800
Yes.

16:08.480 --> 16:13.200
Don't you think it's strange that 
you'd go from a skeleton to a ghoul?

16:14.410 --> 16:19.210
Existential evolution is when a monster 
transforms into a more powerful being.

16:19.210 --> 16:23.120
Well, that's the current definition, 
regardless of what the exact truth is.

16:23.120 --> 16:24.120
That's right.

16:24.350 --> 16:27.790
So is a ghoul the only monster 
superior to a skeleton?

16:27.790 --> 16:32.850
Well, there's a skeleton soldier, a skeleton 
knight... there's a lot of things.

16:32.850 --> 16:37.070
There are reports of skeletons 
becoming ghouls, yes.

16:37.070 --> 16:41.260
But as for whether that's a coincidence, 
or if there's some reason...

16:43.010 --> 16:44.570
We know nothing!

16:45.860 --> 16:48.710
But there's one thing we can infer.

16:50.050 --> 16:56.230
The monster is evolving into 
the form it wishes to take.

16:57.610 --> 17:02.740
You kept saying you wanted 
to become more human, didn't you?

17:03.540 --> 17:05.520
That's right.

17:05.520 --> 17:09.450
But then couldn't I have become 
a vampire instead of a ghast?

17:09.450 --> 17:13.230
A vampire looks more human.

17:13.230 --> 17:16.600
It's probably like the adventurer's guild.

17:16.600 --> 17:19.770
You can't jump from Iron to Gold, can you?

17:19.770 --> 17:22.470
There must be conditions and 
aptitudes that you need to meet.

17:23.180 --> 17:24.220
I see!

17:24.220 --> 17:26.710
Experiments using smaller monsters

17:26.710 --> 17:30.210
have shown they existential evolve into 
a form adapted to their environment.

17:30.210 --> 17:33.320
In a volcanic area, to a form 
with high fire affinity,

17:33.320 --> 17:36.830
near water, to a form with 
high water affinity.

17:38.120 --> 17:42.470
It's possible that this evolution was a 
passive reaction to their environment.

17:42.470 --> 17:46.030
But if it happened in response 
to the monster's will...?

17:46.030 --> 17:51.130
There are some leaps of logic there, but it 
seems to me like you have that potential.

17:51.630 --> 17:56.510
Which means if I work hard enough, 
I might become a vampire someday?

17:57.500 --> 18:02.300
And someday... go back to being human?

18:02.300 --> 18:05.110
The former I can say is a possibility.

18:05.110 --> 18:07.800
The latter, I have no idea.

18:07.800 --> 18:08.820
Of course.

18:09.400 --> 18:11.810
I imagine that any further 
existential evolutions

18:11.810 --> 18:14.510
will involve more than 
just defeating monsters.

18:16.010 --> 18:17.440
I see...

18:18.160 --> 18:22.270
Just like how I became a ghast by 
ingesting your flesh and blood,

18:22.270 --> 18:25.070
there must be some condition 
for becoming a vampire.

18:25.070 --> 18:27.420
Yeah. I think that's the case.

18:28.050 --> 18:30.360
There's so much we don't know.

18:30.360 --> 18:31.800
What did you expect?

18:31.800 --> 18:34.270
Even what I just said is just a hypothesis.

18:34.270 --> 18:35.750
You could even call it a fantasy.

18:37.100 --> 18:39.730
It's a long road ahead, either way.

18:40.040 --> 18:42.700
I'll help you as best I can.

18:43.310 --> 18:44.730
Thank you.

18:45.080 --> 18:46.560
Don't worry about it.

18:51.490 --> 18:53.730
Now, let me start checking things.

18:54.520 --> 18:55.910
Start by taking off your clothes.

18:56.240 --> 19:00.490
I'm going to use a magic item to take 
pictures of every inch of your body for my records.

19:00.490 --> 19:02.690
And let me cut off part of your body.

19:02.690 --> 19:03.700
C-Cut off?

19:03.700 --> 19:05.280
Yeah. I want to see if you feel pain.

19:05.280 --> 19:06.360
D-Dunno...

19:06.360 --> 19:08.670
I can prepare an anesthetic, 
but will it work on you?

19:09.860 --> 19:12.670
Then let's test that and a 
bunch of other medical stuff!

19:12.670 --> 19:15.630
We need to test your 
sleep and appetite, too.

19:15.880 --> 19:18.780
Find out for me if you can 
eat normal food later.

19:18.780 --> 19:21.500
And if you're closer to a vampire now...

19:21.500 --> 19:23.770
Well, we can start our experiments tomorrow.

19:24.080 --> 19:26.970
You must be tired today.

19:29.520 --> 19:33.020
I do have a little bit of common 
sense, you know. Once in a while.

19:34.020 --> 19:35.480
Once in a while...

19:36.060 --> 19:39.060
That's true. Once in a while.

19:51.450 --> 19:55.100
<i>I feel fine. Good, actually.</i>

19:55.100 --> 19:57.760
<i>That strange impulse from yesterday is gone.</i>

20:01.300 --> 20:04.620
<i>I can't go into the labyrinth 
with my sword like this.</i>

20:04.620 --> 20:07.100
<i>Clope will be so mad...</i>

20:07.750 --> 20:08.800
Hey.

20:09.770 --> 20:11.440
What is this?

20:12.130 --> 20:14.010
Your... sword.

20:17.380 --> 20:19.840
You ruined it.

20:19.840 --> 20:22.120
The materials are useless now.

20:22.400 --> 20:24.300
I can't repair this.

20:24.300 --> 20:26.960
I'm sorry... I imbued it with divinity.

20:28.100 --> 20:31.030
That would explain the damage, but...

20:31.030 --> 20:35.300
There are no enemies in the Labyrinth of the 
Moon's Reflection that call for divinity.

20:35.300 --> 20:37.480
I met a giant skeleton.

20:37.480 --> 20:38.930
No way in hell did you—

20:38.930 --> 20:42.760
No, you wouldn't lie about that.

20:43.140 --> 20:44.760
But where?

20:45.060 --> 20:46.980
I found an unexplored area.

20:46.980 --> 20:48.430
Ren—

20:50.150 --> 20:51.840
No... <i>you</i>.

20:51.840 --> 20:55.000
Is that... true?

20:57.600 --> 20:59.900
An unexplored area.

20:59.900 --> 21:02.110
So that explains it.

21:02.110 --> 21:05.950
I wondered why you looked so 
weird when you came here.

21:06.240 --> 21:08.700
So, did you get to explore it?

21:08.700 --> 21:10.090
Not yet.

21:10.090 --> 21:14.620
So I hate to ask, but I'd like that 
sword I asked for as soon as possible.

21:14.880 --> 21:16.120
I assume so.

21:16.410 --> 21:19.850
You can't let the others explore it first.

21:20.300 --> 21:24.640
But the sword you asked for isn't ready yet.

21:25.510 --> 21:27.970
So I'll lend you another.

21:27.970 --> 21:29.250
Really?

21:29.650 --> 21:30.560
Yeah.

21:30.560 --> 21:32.480
I'll give you something a little better.

21:34.000 --> 21:37.020
You're one of our best customers, after all.

21:37.870 --> 21:41.020
<i>Yeah, I should've known I wouldn't fool him.</i>

21:41.280 --> 21:43.720
<i>Well, he lent me a new sword.</i>

21:43.940 --> 21:46.720
<i>I can't wait to get done in the labyrinth 
and do another existential evolution.</i>

21:46.720 --> 21:49.510
Hey, give me all those veggies. All of them!

21:49.510 --> 21:52.280
Can you come down a little 
on the price of that meat?

21:52.280 --> 21:54.110
